flowchart TD
  PWR[上电] --> INIT[main初始化/InitUserData]
  INIT --> RTOS[创建任务/启动调度]
  RTOS --> PROC[ProcessControlTask]

  PROC --> MODE{nStartMode==3?}
  MODE -- 否 --> PROC
  MODE -- 是 --> WAIT[定点模式待机 nAutoRun=0]

  WAIT -->|RTC Alarm A| RTC[RTC_Alarm_IRQHandler]
  RTC --> SET[AutoStep=1 RW50=1 nAutoRun=1]
  SET --> DETECT[ProcessControlTask检测nAutoRun>0]
  DETECT --> START[清零nAutoRun nDevBeRunning=1]
  START --> AR[AutoRun AutoStep状态机]

  AR --> STEPS[执行AutoStep 1..19]
  STEPS --> STEP20[AutoStep=20 模式收尾]
  STEP20 --> ALARM[Set_MultiAlarm 设置下一闹钟]
  ALARM --> EXIT[AutoStep=0 退出等待]
  EXIT --> WAIT
